USING iceberg
COMMENT 'Work Product Component describing an individual instance of a wellbore trajectory data object. Also called a directional or deviation survey, wellbore trajectory is data that is used to calculate the position and spatial uncertainty of a planned or actual wellbore in 2-dimensional and 3-dimensional space.'
TBLPROPERTIES (
  'format-version' = '2',
  'write.format.default' = 'parquet',
  'osdu.kind' = 'osdu:wks:work-product-component--WellboreTrajectory:1.4.0',
  'osdu.source-schema' = 'https://schema.osdu.opengroup.org/json/work-product-component/WellboreTrajectory.1.4.0.json',
  'osdu.source-sha256' = '38e2136ccdac9119d6320a979a8e53f2e3bdb5bfb24c8ca8396730329d00fbc9'
);

