USING iceberg
COMMENT 'Wellbore Markers identify the depth in a wellbore, measured below a reference elevation, at which a person or an automated process identifies a noteworthy observation, which is usually a change in the rock that intersects that wellbore. Formation Marker data includes attributes/properties that put these depths in context. Formation Markers are sometimes known as picks or formation tops.'
TBLPROPERTIES (
  'format-version' = '2',
  'write.format.default' = 'parquet',
