USING iceberg
COMMENT 'Well Tubular data contains information on the tubular assemblies and their components for the well, wellbore, or wellbore completion (as appropriate). The tubulars can be tubing, casing or liners or other related equipment which is installed into the well. Tubulars can also be equipment which is lowered into the well in the context of drilling, which is then pulled back out.'
TBLPROPERTIES (
  'format-version' = '2',
  'write.format.default' = 'parquet',
  'osdu.kind' = 'osdu:wks:work-product-component--TubularComponent:1.3.0',
  'osdu.source-schema' = 'https://schema.osdu.opengroup.org/json/work-product-component/TubularComponent.1.3.0.json',
  'osdu.source-sha256' = '9f2679500742e8b6633219837b0053f44b83eaf857af9e453a3451c206b03e47'
);

